/addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A method of treating resin or organic compound, or waste plastics containing them, wherein resin, or organic compound, or waste plastics containing them is partly burned in a blast furnace and the remaining portion is pyrolyzed in a coke oven.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un procédé de traitement de résine ou de composé organique, ou de déchets de plastiques les contenant. Ledit procédé consiste à brûler partiellement la résine, le composé organique ou les déchets de plastique dans un haut-fourneau et à faire subir une pyrolyse à la partie restante, dans un four à coke.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>